OL,3,ALawyers called back to courtroom in
OL,4,ALindsay Clancy murder trial as update
OL,5,Aexpected
OL,6,
OL,7,FClancy, 36, is charged with three
OL,8,Fcounts of first-degree murder in the
OL,9,Fdeaths of her three children - Cora, 5,
OL,10,FDawson, 3, and eight-month-old Callan -
OL,11,Fat their Massachusetts home in 2023
OL,13,FShe does not deny killing them, but her
OL,14,Flawyer argues she was suffering from
OL,15,Fpostpartum psychosis, and could not
OL,16,Fdistinguish right from wrong
